# Empowerwell Support Pty Ltd — environment configuration
# Copy to .env for local development. In production, set these in the Vercel project settings.

# Enquiry form endpoint (optional). Any service that accepts a JSON POST and returns 2xx on success,
# e.g. Formspree (https://formspree.io/f/<id>) or Web3Forms. When empty, the form opens a pre-filled
# email to SITE.email instead, and the page tells the visitor it has not been sent yet.
PUBLIC_FORM_ENDPOINT=""
